+/**
+ * thunar_icon_view_fit_columns:
+ *
+ * The items have a width per zoom level (the "wrap-width" of the names). Whatever is left over in a row used
+ * to stay empty at the right edge. Here the number of columns that fit is worked out and the width of every
+ * item is stretched so that the columns fill the view exactly, with the name on one line (ellipsis).
+ **/
+static void
